        default_raw_text = "OH GOD, the station is still creaking from a heavy impact in the port direction. The power is down, coms not responding, the air supply pipe depressurized and I can feel the artificial gravity weakening. The whole department is running around in panic. I'll just pray that engineers won't let the engine delaminate.<br><br> ...And the alien spawn have broken out of the containment area due to the impact and slipped into the vent.<br><br> I have a bad feeling about this, but I doubt that now is the right time to make guys hunt for what they call my \"pet cockroach\"... And RD is scary...";
